{"title":"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If this path is to continue in the same pattern:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/3/b339e873c8534766f60bc07d45fbc1145069b7e4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(24); draw((0,0)--(1,0)--(1,1)--(2,1)--(2,0)--(3,0)--(3,1)--(4,1)--(4,0)--(5,0)--(5,1)--(6,1)); draw((2/3,1/5)--(1,0)--(2/3,-1/5)); draw((4/5,2/3)--(1,1)--(6/5,2/3)); draw((5/3,6/5)--(2,1)--(5/3,4/5)); draw((9/5,1/3)--(2,0)--(11/5,1/3)); draw((8/3,1/5)--(3,0)--(8/3,-1/5)); draw((14/5,2/3)--(3,1)--(16/5,2/3)); draw((11/3,6/5)--(4,1)--(11/3,4/5)); draw((19/5,1/3)--(4,0)--(21/5,1/3)); draw((14/3,1/5)--(5,0)--(14/3,-1/5)); draw((24/5,2/3)--(5,1)--(26/5,2/3)); draw((17/3,6/5)--(6,1)--(17/3,4/5)); dot((0,0)); dot((1,0)); dot((1,1)); dot((2,1)); dot((2,0)); dot((3,0)); dot((3,1)); dot((4,1)); dot((4,0)); dot((5,0)); dot((5,1)); label(&quot;$0$&quot;,(0,0),S); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(1,0),S); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(1,1),N); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,(2,1),N); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,(2,0),S); label(&quot;$5$&quot;,(3,0),S); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(3,1),N); label(&quot;$7$&quot;,(4,1),N); label(&quot;$8$&quot;,(4,0),S); label(&quot;$9$&quot;,(5,0),S); label(&quot;$10$&quot;,(5,1),N); label(&quot;$\\vdots$&quot;,(5.85,0.5),E); label(&quot;$\\cdots$&quot;,(6.5,0.15),S); [/asy]\" width=\"282\" height=\"85\" />\n</p><p>then which sequence of arrows goes from point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/6/f167612295ce2601bd901b9721fa6c879dfa52cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$425$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> to point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12dfb4ec3d7a21965302063f51738293e5a1cfb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$427$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/e/e5eb08a30433a9fcb5c7b4a3012e6bd2727902d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(24); dot((0,0)); dot((0,1)); dot((1,1)); draw((0,0)--(0,1)--(1,1)); draw((-1/5,2/3)--(0,1)--(1/5,2/3)); draw((2/3,6/5)--(1,1)--(2/3,4/5)); label(&quot;(A)&quot;,(-1/3,1/3),W); dot((4,0)); dot((5,0)); dot((5,1)); draw((4,0)--(5,0)--(5,1)); draw((14/3,1/5)--(5,0)--(14/3,-1/5)); draw((24/5,2/3)--(5,1)--(26/5,2/3)); label(&quot;(B)&quot;,(11/3,1/3),W); dot((8,1)); dot((8,0)); dot((9,0)); draw((8,1)--(8,0)--(9,0)); draw((39/5,1/3)--(8,0)--(41/5,1/3)); draw((26/3,1/5)--(9,0)--(26/3,-1/5)); label(&quot;(C)&quot;,(23/3,1/3),W); dot((12,1)); dot((13,1)); dot((13,0)); draw((12,1)--(13,1)--(13,0)); draw((38/3,6/5)--(13,1)--(38/3,4/5)); draw((64/5,1/3)--(13,0)--(66/5,1/3)); label(&quot;(D)&quot;,(35/3,1/3),W); dot((17,1)); dot((17,0)); dot((16,0)); draw((17,1)--(17,0)--(16,0)); draw((84/5,1/3)--(17,0)--(86/5,1/3)); draw((49/3,1/5)--(16,0)--(49/3,-1/5)); label(&quot;(E)&quot;,(47/3,1/3),W); [/asy]\" width=\"742\" height=\"58\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice the pattern from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> repeats for every four arrows. Any number that has a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> corresponds to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/6/f167612295ce2601bd901b9721fa6c879dfa52cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$425$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The arrows from point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/6/f167612295ce2601bd901b9721fa6c879dfa52cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$425$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> to point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12dfb4ec3d7a21965302063f51738293e5a1cfb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$427$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> correspond to points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which have the same pattern as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/1/0c1c9d1b1e9b85d185f077bab73eb0531dd6f2e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"37\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME\" title=\"1994 AJHSME\">1994 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\